@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5127

### Liveness: processo vivo (nao depende do banco)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness: dependencias criticas (SQL Server). 503 se indisponivel
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Todos os health checks
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Documento OpenAPI (somente Development)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Cadastro de usuario (publico)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "CorrectHorse-Battery-2026" }

### Login (publico). Copie o accessToken retornado para a variavel abaixo
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "CorrectHorse-Battery-2026" }

### Usuario autenticado (requer Bearer). 401 sem token
@token = <cole o accessToken aqui>
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
